{"title": "Speak with Dead", "pageid": 2761, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Speak_with_Dead", "categories": ["Spells that last until long rest", "Spells", "Level 3 Spells", "Necromancy spells", "Ritual spells", "Actions", "Recastable spells"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Speak_with_Dead.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Speak_with_Dead.webp/300px-Speak_with_Dead.webp, /w/images/f/fa/Speak_with_Dead.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Speak_with_Dead.webp/300px-Speak_with_Dead.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Speak_with_Dead.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Speak with Dead </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 3 necromancy spell</a>. It allows spellcasters to grant a semblance of life to a corpse, allowing it to answer questions.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Grant a semblance of life to a corpse, allowing it to answer questions. \n</p><p>Skeletons and creatures killed with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span></a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a> damage no longer have a mouth and can't be made to talk using this spell.\n</p>\nDoesn't work on Undead.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 3 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 9 m (30 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 9 m (30 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Ritual_spells\" title=\"Spells\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/25px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/38px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ritual\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/25px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Ritual_spells\" title=\"Spells\">Ritual</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_SpeakWithDead</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_SpeakWithDead\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_SpeakWithDead\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Recast_Speak_with_Dead\"> Condition: Recast Speak with Dead </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Recast_Speak_with_Dead_(Condition)\" title=\"Recast Speak with Dead (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Recast_Speak_with_Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Recast_Speak_with_Dead_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/96/Recast_Speak_with_Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Recast_Speak_with_Dead_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/96/Recast_Speak_with_Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Recast_Speak_with_Dead_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Recast Speak with Dead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Recast_Speak_with_Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Recast_Speak_with_Dead_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/96/Recast_Speak_with_Dead_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Recast_Speak_with_Dead_(Condition)\" title=\"Recast Speak with Dead (Condition)\">Recast Speak with Dead</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Can recast Speak with Dead without expending a <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Slot\">spell slot</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 5: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Cleric</a></li></ul>\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Caster:_Free_Spells\" title=\"Ritual Caster: Free Spells\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/25px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/38px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/50px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ritual Caster: Free Spells\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp/25px-Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Ritual_Caster_Free_Spells_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Caster:_Free_Spells\" title=\"Ritual Caster: Free Spells\">Ritual Caster: Free Spells</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Amulet_of_Lost_Voices\" title=\"The Amulet of Lost Voices\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Amulet_of_Lost_Voices_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_of_Lost_Voices_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Amulet_of_Lost_Voices_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Amulet_of_Lost_Voices_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Amulet_of_Lost_Voices_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Amulet_of_Lost_Voices_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Amulet_of_Lost_Voices_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_of_Lost_Voices_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Amulet_of_Lost_Voices_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Amulet_of_Lost_Voices\" title=\"The Amulet of Lost Voices\">The Amulet of Lost Voices</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necromancy_of_Thay\" title=\"Necromancy of Thay\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Book_Thay_A_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Necromancy_of_Thay\" title=\"Necromancy of Thay\">Necromancy of Thay</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Also granted to <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlocks</a> who choose the <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Invocation\" title=\"Eldritch Invocation\">Eldritch Invocation</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Whispers_of_the_Grave\" title=\"Whispers of the Grave\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/20px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/40px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Whispers of the Grave\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/20px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Whispers_of_the_Grave\" title=\"Whispers of the Grave\">Whispers of the Grave</a> at level 9+.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a> <em>cannot</em> <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Scroll of Speak with Dead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Scroll_of_Speak_With_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Speak_With_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Scroll_of_Speak_With_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Speak_With_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Scroll_of_Speak_With_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Speak_With_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Scroll_of_Speak_With_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Speak_With_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Scroll_of_Speak_With_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Scroll of Speak with Dead\">Scroll of Speak with Dead</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>With <a href=\"/wiki/Naaber\" title=\"Naaber\">one</a> notable exception, each corpse only answers five questions before the spell loses its power.</li>\n<li>Casting this spell also affords <i>Recast Speak with Dead</i>, as a <i>granted spell</i>. <i>Granted spells</i> allow the spellcaster to recast a like copy of the original without expending a spell slot, until the next <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.</li>\n<li>Most corpses are unwilling to speak with the caster if they dealt the killing blow or they were in the active party during the combat where the victim was killed. While not always the case, this can be circumvented by applying <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self\" title=\"Disguise Self\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/20px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/30px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/40px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disguise Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp/20px-Disguise_Self_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Disguise_Self_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disguise_Self\" title=\"Disguise Self\">Disguise Self</a> spell before casting this.</li>\n<li>For the list of NPCs this spell can be used on see <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Available_to_Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Category:Available to Speak with Dead\">Category:Available to Speak with Dead</a>.</li>\n<li>If cast by a <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Cleric</a> from their spell list and not from a scroll, the spell must remain <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Prepared_Spells\" title=\"Spells\">Prepared</a>. If removed from the Cleric's Prepared Spells list, they lose the ability to use <i>Recast Speak with Dead</i> until preparing and casting Speak with Dead once more. Meanwhile, applicable corpses do not show a green glow to indicate they can be spoken to. If cast with a <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Scroll of Speak with Dead\">scroll</a> or item, the caster need not keep this spell prepared, and can use <b>Recast Speak with Dead</b> until their next Long Rest.</li>\n<li>Keeping a collection of corpses in the Traveler's Chest at camp can be a useful way to activate \"Recast Speak with Dead\" after each long rest, to get the green glow on \"speak-able\" corpses, though this can only be done once per corpse.</li>\n<li>Using Speak with Dead grants the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sage#Whispers_from_the_Grave\" title=\"Sage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Whispers from the Grave\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Sage#Whispers_from_the_Grave\" title=\"Sage\">Whispers from the Grave</a> inspiration to party members with the <a href=\"/wiki/Sage\" title=\"Sage\">Sage</a> background.</li>\n<li>The incantation for Speak With Dead is <b>Cum Mortuus in Lingua Mortua</b>, Latin for <i>\"With the dead in a dead language\"</i> or <b>In Nocte Consignē</b>, Latin for <i>\"Mark/seal in night.\"</i></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Speak_with_dead\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with dead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Speak_with_dead\">Speak with dead</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034844\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.120 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.126 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6589/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 88401/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 38714/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.037/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1774676/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n115.43%  118.332     88 Template:Trim\n100.00%  102.513      1 -total\n 97.22%   99.662      1 Template:Feature_page\n 25.28%   25.914     15 Template:Icon_text\n 21.02%   21.550     12 Template:Icon_link\n 13.16%   13.489      3 Template:Item_icon\n 11.32%   11.601      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 10.40%   10.659      2 Template:MdRarityItem\n 10.32%   10.584      5 Template:DamageType\n  9.14%    9.370     21 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash: